, premium decking, and upscale outdoor living space.\" class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"grid-row row2\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/south-florida-custom-pool-builders-modern-backyard-design.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" data-w-id=\"8bad508e-9f02-2bc9-bf6d-6ac47990da3b\" alt=\"Modern custom pool in North Florida with clean geometric design, high-end finishes, and professionally designed outdoor living area.\" class=\"image\"></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"90fb4871-cccb-5a13-f9e4-95b1df0636a2\" class=\"trusted-divider-right\"><div class=\"block-contect-intro\"><h2 class=\"white\">Your Luxury Outdoor Living &amp; Pool Specialists in North Florida</h2><div class=\"text-divider white\"><p>We proudly serve homeowners across North Florida with sophisticated design, premium craftsmanship, and a seamless project experience. Our team combines modern engineering, durable materials, and thoughtful planning to deliver outdoor spaces built for comfort, performance, and long-term value. From concept to completion, we prioritize clear communication, respect timelines and budgets, and provide a true white-glove experience.</p><div class=\"div-block-7\"><div class=\"wrapper-cities-cms w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"list-cities-cms-copy w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-marion-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Marion County</div></a></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-putnam-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Putnam County</div></a></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-alachua-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Alachua County</div></a></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-columbia-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Columbia County</div></a></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-levy-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Levy County</div></a></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-dixie-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Dixie County</div></a></div><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a href=\"/country/custom-pool-builders-gilchrist-county-fl\" class=\"link-block-page w-inline-block\"><img src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon thin\"><div>Gilchrist County</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-buttons\"><a href=\"/about\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">More About Us</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>";
const T2 = "<section class=\"animated-divs-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"330b3a3f-e72c-3f91-1f24-8dfe4f37952f\" class=\"header-feature\"><h2 class=\"white\">Featured Luxury Pool Projects Across North Florida</h2><p>Our advanced 3D rendering technology allows you to preview your North Florida luxury pool and outdoor living space before construction begins. As luxury pool builders in North Florida, we create photorealistic designs that help you explore layouts, materials, and finishes in detail. This collaborative process improves clarity, minimizes surprises, and ensures your final project reflects your vision with confidence.</p></div><div data-w-id=\"330b3a3f-e72c-3f91-1f24-8dfe4f379534\" class=\"wrapper-feature\"><div id=\"w-node-_330b3a3f-e72c-3f91-1f24-8dfe4f379535-4f37952d\" class=\"feature-card is-active\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Energy Efficient Systems</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Engineered energy-efficient systems include variable-speed pumps, saltwater systems, efficient heaters, and LED lighting—designed to reduce operating costs and improve long-term pool performance.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-1.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-1-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-1-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-1-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-1.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Smart Automation</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Smart pool automation allows seamless control of filtration, heating, lighting, and water features from one system—improving efficiency, convenience, and the overall luxury pool experience.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-2.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Water Features</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Custom water features such as sheer descents, scuppers, bubblers, and spillover spas are engineered to enhance visual impact, movement, and sound while integrating seamlessly into the pool design.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-3.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-3-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-3-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-3-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-3.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Fire &amp; Lighting Features</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Fire bowls, fire pits, and architectural lighting create dramatic outdoor environments, extending usability into the evening while enhancing ambiance, safety, and visual depth.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9739379882812px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-4-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-4-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-4-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-4.webp 1260w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Safety &amp; Comfort</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Integrated safety and comfort features include slip-resistant surfaces, pool covers, handrails, and code-compliant barriers—designed to meet Florida regulations without sacrificing aesthetics.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature-card\"><img src=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-5.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9817504882812px, 939.9869384765625px\" srcset=\"/images/site/adobe-express-file-5-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-5-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-5-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/adobe-express-file-5.webp 1251w\" class=\"feature-image\"><div class=\"block-feature\"><div class=\"pill-feature\"><h3 class=\"title-feature\">Outdoor Living Enhancements</h3></div><p class=\"feature-text\">Outdoor living design-build enhancements include outdoor kitchens, pergolas, hardscaping, and architectural shade structures—fully integrated to create a cohesive, high-end outdoor environment.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"w-embed w-script\"><style>\n/* Solo desktop (≥ 992px) */\n@media screen and (min-width: 992px) {\n  .feature-text {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transition: opacity 200ms;\n  }\n\n  .feature-card.is-active .block-feature .feature-text {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n  // Solo activar animación si realmente estamos en desktop\n  var isDesk